Subject: [PATCH 14/42] feat(amdgpu): add bounded host-native PT_LOAD
 materializer

Reuse the committed code-object staging validator and host memory oracle to materialize the locked gfx950 gpuReadWrite PT_LOAD image in a no-x86 target. Keep the gate fixture-scoped and explicit about the AQL/execution boundary.

Checkpoint-ID: CP-0017

Goal-ID: GSIM-001

Plan-Revision: 2

